How to read this:
  L2infl  > 1.2x  the hot loop was measuring cache, not HBM. Rotation is
                  doing real work; never report the hot number alone.
  launch% > 30%   dispatch dominates. Any un-graphed benchmark at this M
                  is measuring the launcher.
  %ideal > 100%  IMPOSSIBLE. The harness or the denominator is wrong --
                  stop and fix it before trusting anything downstream.

